  m_Name: InventoryPage
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: BoundSpiritRuntime::JournalPage
  leftPageText: 'DIALOGUE:

    Some people love to blabber. When in a dialogue,
    press ''Space'' to speed through or progress to the next line of dialogue.'
  rightPageText: 'INVENTORY:

    Some of the things you interact with get picked
    up. These go into your inventory. Access inventory by pressing ''I''. While in
    the inventory, you can click or hover objects to read more about them. You may
    close inventory by again pressing ''I''.'
